{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlipSum is a bold new twist on classic number puzzles! Inspired by sudoku, this brain-teasing series challenges you to flip, cancel, and balance numbers on a grid to match the target totals. It\u2019s a thrilling game of logic, deduction, and number play\u2014perfect for puzzle lovers who crave something fresh and clever. Get ready to see numbers in a whole new light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How To Play:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark numbers as positive, negative, or cancel them out. Only one number may be cancelled per row / column. Can you balance the entire grid so that each column / row adds up to the correct number?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 Difficulty Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite Puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Counter Per Difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track Your Total Points To Show Off To Your Friends!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927260?t=1755682524","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3927260?t=1755682524","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927260/db4e0b6615b88ed6d90bb66410d7d62c443794d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755682524","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927260/db4e0b6615b88ed6d90bb66410d7d62c443794d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755682524","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FlipSum is a bold new twist on classic number puzzles! Inspired by sudoku, this brain-teasing series challenges you to flip, cancel, and balance numbers on a grid to match the 